    "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action cinematic medium close-up of a lighthouse keeper in a weathered yellow oilskin coat on a wet stone balcony at dusk. The keeper grips a rusted railing, turns toward the lens, and says: <d>[English] The storm is coming. Secure the boats.</d> The keeper closes their mouth and turns back toward the sea.\noverall_soundscape: Heavy rain on oilskin, deep ocean swells breaking against rock, and gusting wind around the iron railing.\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse tense orchestral underscore with a sustained low cello drone and distant solo violin, no percussion.",
